## Professional School Management System (Docker)

# MongoDB URI
# - Docker compose: mongodb://mongodb:27017/psms
# - Local MongoDB: mongodb://localhost:27017
MONGO_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017

# JWT (change in production)
JWT_SECRET=CHANGE_ME_TO_A_LONG_RANDOM_SECRET_32CHARS_MIN
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=7d

# Backend CORS allowed origins (comma-separated)
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000

# Initial seeded admin (created on backend start if no admin exists)
SEED_ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@school.com
SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD=admin123
SEED_ADMIN_NAME=System Admin

# Frontend API base URL (baked into build)
REACT_APP_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api

